# .env.example for skill `github-search`
# Aggregated into <scope>/skills/github-search/config/.env by
# `make -C skillshub setup-env`. Fill in the real value in your
# operator-config.yaml (secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN), NOT here.
#
# Optional. Without it, github-search still works anonymously at GitHub's
# lower unauthenticated REST search rate limit.

GITHUB_TOKEN=
